    fixed: "the lock covers the swap and the bind that must not race a second arm, and nothing else; disarm takes the slot in a statement of its own because an if-let on the lock holds the guard for the whole body. The regression test holds an exchange open through the reachable proxy and polls across the whole drain window - reading once raced ahead of the lock and passed against the bug (5d192d6)"
